{
  "an4.38:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.38 ",
  "an4.38:0.2": "4. Cakkavagga ",
  "an4.38:0.3": "Patilīnasutta ",
  "an4.38:1.1": "“Panuṇṇapaccekasacco, bhikkhave, bhikkhu ‘samavayasaṭṭhesano passaddhakāyasaṅkhāro patilīno’ti vuccati. ",
  "an4.38:1.2": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, bhikkhu panuṇṇapaccekasacco hoti? ",
  "an4.38:1.3": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno yāni tāni puthusamaṇabrāhmaṇānaṁ puthupaccekasaccāni, seyyathidaṁ—",
  "an4.38:1.4": "sassato lokoti vā, asassato lokoti vā, antavā lokoti vā, anantavā lokoti vā, taṁ jīvaṁ taṁ sarīranti vā, aññaṁ jīvaṁ aññaṁ sarīranti vā, hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇāti vā, na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇāti vā, hoti ca na ca hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇāti vā, neva hoti na na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇāti vā; ",
  "an4.38:1.5": "sabbāni tāni nuṇṇāni honti panuṇṇāni cattāni vantāni muttāni pahīnāni paṭinissaṭṭhāni. ",
  "an4.38:1.6": "Evaṁ kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu panuṇṇapaccekasacco hoti. ",
  "an4.38:2.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, bhikkhu samavayasaṭṭhesano hoti? ",
  "an4.38:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno kāmesanā pahīnā hoti, bhavesanā pahīnā hoti, brahmacariyesanā paṭippassaddhā. ",
  "an4.38:2.3": "Evaṁ kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu samavayasaṭṭhesano hoti. ",
  "an4.38:3.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, bhikkhu passaddhakāyasaṅkhāro hoti? ",
  "an4.38:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu sukhassa ca pahānā dukkhassa ca pahānā pubbeva soman